Paolo Barreto is a painter from [[Geography/Tormeré/index|Tormeré]], famous enough that the [[Geography/Calaria/Hallia/Metropolitan Conservatory|MetCon]] in [[Geography/Calaria/Hallia/index|Hallia]] gave him its main exhibit. His works on show there are *The Six*, six abstract canvases for the six Outer Gods, and, in the next room, a sculpture of a solid ball of gold.

Barreto is in jail for heresy. He expects to be out again soon.
